        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Aim for Ten Lights. Deal 10 quadrillion damage.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crouching Tiger Hidden Hanafuda is a hyper-inflation hanafuda roguelite where you power up traditional hanafuda cards, break the rules, and turn classic sets into absurd damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build sets to strike your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call Koi-Koi to keep the round going and raise your JACKPOT multiplier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your cards in the shop, add new symbols to them, level up your sets, and create explosive combos with Animal Cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your cards. Break your sets. Push your luck with Koi-Koi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a single impossible play, unleash damage no ordinary hanafuda game could ever allow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Authentic Hanafuda, Made to Be Broken</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add new symbols to your cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your scoring sets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack your JACKPOT multiplier with Koi-Koi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger wild combos with Animal Cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before long, sets that could never exist in normal hanafuda start appearing,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and your damage climbs past trillions, quadrillions, and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far can you push hanafuda into total inflation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Cards and Create Impossible Sets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shop, you can upgrade the hanafuda cards themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise a card’s point value to increase your base damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add moon, animal, or other symbols to make powerful sets easier to form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, add a boar, a deer, and a butterfly to a single card,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and that one card can complete the classic Boar-Deer-Butterflies set all by itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create combinations that should be impossible,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and build your own ultimate hanafuda deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Raise the JACKPOT with Koi-Koi！</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you complete a set, you choose:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cash out and attack, or call Koi-Koi and keep going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cash out to deal damage right away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call Koi-Koi to build your JACKPOT and aim for an even bigger set.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there is a catch:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the JACKPOT multiplier also powers up enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get greedy, and you might end the fight in one blow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail, and the enemy might do the same to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knowing when to stop is the difference between victory and defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build Combos with Animal Cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You can also buy Animal Cards from the shop.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some increase your damage multiplier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some boost the money you earn after winning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some reveal their true power only when combined with specific cards or sets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When card upgrades, set levels, and Animal Card effects all click together,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your damage will explode beyond reason.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Aim for Ten Lights. Deal 10 quadrillion damage.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crouching Tiger Hidden Hanafuda is a hyper-inflation hanafuda roguelite where you power up traditional hanafuda cards, break the rules, and turn classic sets into absurd damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build sets to strike your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call Koi-Koi to keep the round going and raise your JACKPOT multiplier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your cards in the shop, add new symbols to them, level up your sets, and create explosive combos with Animal Cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your cards. Break your sets. Push your luck with Koi-Koi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a single impossible play, unleash damage no ordinary hanafuda game could ever allow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Authentic Hanafuda, Made to Be Broken</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add new symbols to your cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your scoring sets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack your JACKPOT multiplier with Koi-Koi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger wild combos with Animal Cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before long, sets that could never exist in normal hanafuda start appearing,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and your damage climbs past trillions, quadrillions, and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far can you push hanafuda into total inflation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Cards and Create Impossible Sets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shop, you can upgrade the hanafuda cards themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise a card’s point value to increase your base damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add moon, animal, or other symbols to make powerful sets easier to form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, add a boar, a deer, and a butterfly to a single card,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and that one card can complete the classic Boar-Deer-Butterflies set all by itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create combinations that should be impossible,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and build your own ultimate hanafuda deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Raise the JACKPOT with Koi-Koi！</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you complete a set, you choose:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cash out and attack, or call Koi-Koi and keep going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cash out to deal damage right away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call Koi-Koi to build your JACKPOT and aim for an even bigger set.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there is a catch:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the JACKPOT multiplier also powers up enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get greedy, and you might end the fight in one blow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail, and the enemy might do the same to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knowing when to stop is the difference between victory and defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build Combos with Animal Cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You can also buy Animal Cards from the shop.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some increase your damage multiplier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some boost the money you earn after winning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some reveal their true power only when combined with specific cards or sets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When card upgrades, set levels, and Animal Card effects all click together,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your damage will explode beyond reason.</p>",
